$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("[[Duration: ~9 min | Difficulty: Easy]] A Viper squadron was caught in a jump scatter and the pilots ejected into the debris. The Raptor Lifeline has a few minutes to find and recover every one of them before the Raiders do. Red flight keeps her alive.", -1)
$end_multi_text

