$start_briefing
$num_stages: 1
$start_stage
$multi_text
 XSTR("A Viper squadron was caught in a jump scatter and the pilots ejected into the debris. The Raptor Lifeline has a few minutes to find and recover every one of them before the Raiders do. Red flight keeps her alive. Objectives. Bring all 4 pilots aboard the Raptor.", -1)
$end_multi_text
$voice: XM-Pods-B-01.ogg
